      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Ratio of capital investment (capx) to revenue (revt) divided by the firm-specific 36-month rolling mean of that ratio. Exclude if revenue less than \\$10m. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=VW；LSQuantile=0.2；PortfolioPeriod=12.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=-1.0；TestInOP=port sort, characteristic adjusted。股票池/过滤：过滤列为空；定义/注释中的股票池限制：Ratio of capital investment (capx) to revenue (revt) divided by the firm-specific 36-month rolling mean of that ratio. Exclude if revenue less than \\$10m.。 Notes：OP mean return is only 17 bps per month characteristic adjusted. We deviate somewhat from OP in the port sort by going LS 5-1 instead of (4+5) - (1+2) because OP value weights within each quintile which we can't do easily in our code.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
